#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/production-orders.adoc:4
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Another mode of the factory gauge, \"follow demand and order\", "
#| "additionally allows the item produceable by a gauge to be manually "
#| "ordered from a stock keeper tuned to the same network. In stock keeper "
#| "UI, each gauge in this mode appears as a production task, signified by a "
#| "blueprint background."
msgid ""
"Factory gauges set to the xref:factory-gauge.adoc#production-orders[\"follow "
"demand and order\" mode] allow their products to be manually ordered from a "
"stock keeper tuned to the same network. In the stock keeper UI, each gauge "
"in this mode appears as a [#term-production-task]_production task_, "
"signified by a blueprint background."
msgstr ""
"另一个工作模式，“按需生产与手动请求”，除具备按需生产功能外，还允许玩家在绑定"
"至同一网络的仓库管理员界面中手动请求生产物品。在仓库管理员界面中，每个处于此"
"模式的仪表都会显示为一个生产任务，它们带有蓝图背景。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/production-orders.adoc:9
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Sending an order containing production tasks creates a production order, "
#| "causing the corresponding gauges to add the number of items in the order "
#| "to their demands. When the produced items arrive in the logistic network, "
#| "they are sent out again to the address specified on the order."
msgid ""
"Click to add the production task to the order, and adjust the amount per "
"usual. Sending an order containing production tasks creates a [#term-"
"production-order]_production order_, causing the corresponding factory "
"gauges to add the number of items in the order to their xref:factory-"
"gauge.adoc#term-demand[demands]. When the produced items arrive in the "
"logistic network, they are sent out again to the address specified on the "
"order."
msgstr ""
"提交包含生产任务的订单将会创建生产订单，把订单中的物品数量加入对应仪表的需"
"求。当产物进入物流网络所监测的仓储后，会再次被发往订单指定的地址。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/production-orders.adoc:11
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Pending production orders can be viewed in the \"production orders\" tab "
#| "in the stock keeper UI. They are automatically removed when all ordered "
#| "items arrive in the logistic network, or stuck if they never arrive."
msgid ""
"Pending production orders can be viewed in the \"production orders\" tab in "
"the stock keeper UI. They are automatically removed when all ordered items "
"arrive in the logistic network. Otherwise, they remain stuck if the items "
"never arrive."
msgstr ""
"待处理的生产订单可在仓库管理员界面的“生产订单”标签页查看。所有请求生产的物品"
"进入物流网络后，订单会自动移除。如果物品始终没有到达，订单会一直停留在列表"
"中。"

